	(text "NOTE:\n- The Mux Placement: Place the 5 muxes as close to the nRF54 as possible. \nIt is better to have long traces for the TMR outputs (which are slow DC signals) \nthan long traces for the Mux-to-ADC lines (which carry the \"chosen\" signal).\n- Route the analog traces far away from PWM traces.\n- If aluminum plates are used for case, place 2 dowels to align them.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 173.99 158.242 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
